::Q001::[markdown]on account of:{
	~%-100%διά + gen#Incorrect. **διά + gen** means “through” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%ἄνευ#Incorrect. **ἄνευ** means “without” (Chapter 7).
	~%100%διά + acc#Correct: **διά + acc** → “on account of” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%ἐκ + gen; ἐξ + gen#Incorrect. **ἐκ + gen; ἐξ + gen** means “from” (Chapter 1).
	~%-100%παρά + acc#Incorrect. **παρά + acc** means “to the side of” (Chapter 2).
}


