	~%-100%show#Incorrect. **δηλόω** is Principal Part 1 of **δηλόω** “show” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%do wrong#Incorrect. **ἀδικέω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἀδικέω** “do wrong” (Chapter 9).
	~%-100%hurt#Incorrect. **βλάπτω** is Principal Part 1 of **βλάπτω** “hurt” (Chapter 5).
}


